# mksrv-managed placeholder. Its only job is to make DeployStack's
# write-time `mkdir -p` create this directory before the mail server's
# Quadlet unit bind-mounts it — Podman does not create a missing bind-mount
# source itself, so without this the container fails to start on a fresh
# host with "statfs ...: no such file or directory". Safe to ignore/delete;
# mksrv recreates it (and the directory) on the next deploy.
